<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH cuts prime rate to 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH cuts prime rate to 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano-BCH said it cut its prime rate to eight percent from 8.25 percent.</p>
<p>The Spanish bank announced the cut after the Bank of Spain made its first rate cut this year, trimming its key money market rate to six percent from the previous 6.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
